      "content": "To minimize the impact of existing encroachments on your variance application, you may want to argue that the code should not prevent the applicant from developing a property that complies with the proposed mixed-use zoning, even if it necessitates clearing the existing encroachments. Highlighting the practical difficulties of footloose encroachments on neighboring properties and the inequity of penalizing a single applicant for something that isn't even their fault could also be persuasive.",
